---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Explore the World
description: Every published Koa's Beach Adventures destination, with a whole Pacific still to come.
permalink: /world/
---
{% from "partials/art.njk" import destination as destinationArt %}

<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Explore</span>
    <h1>Choose your adventure</h1>
    <p>Three real places, three real friends — with a whole Pacific still to come.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ================= PUBLISHED ADVENTURES — the three live destinations, given real room ================= -->
<section class="wrap" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="published-adventures reveal-group reveal">
    {% for slug in ["byron-bay", "hawaii", "solomon-islands"] %}
    {% set d = findBySlug(destinations, slug) %}
    <a href="/world/{{ d.slug }}/" class="published-card">
      <div class="published-card-art">{{ destinationArt(d) }}</div>
      <div class="published-card-body">
        <span class="status-chip live">Live</span>
        <h2>{{ d.name }}</h2>
        <p>{{ d.hook }}</p>
        <span class="published-card-cta">Explore {{ d.name }} →</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:48px;">
    <a href="#coming-soon" class="btn ghost">Explore the full world →</a>
  </p>
</section>

<!-- ================= THE VOYAGE — the journey between islands IS the story ================= -->
<section class="wrap" id="voyage">
  <div class="section-head reveal" style="text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">
    <span class="eyebrow">One Continuous Journey</span>
    <h2>The voyage is part of the adventure</h2>
    <p style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">Koa's adventures aren't separate stories — they're one long sail across the Pacific. Every time Koa and Gully leave one island behind, the ocean itself becomes the adventure.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="voyage-art reveal">
    <img src="/assets/ui/voyage.webp" alt="Koa's little patched-sail boat on the open Pacific, a whale surfacing gently beside it" loading="lazy">
  </div>
  <div class="voyage-discoveries reveal">
    <p style="text-align:center;font-family:'Fredoka',sans-serif;color:var(--teal-dark);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:14px;">Out on the open ocean, Koa and Gully discover&hellip;</p>
    <div class="voyage-tags">
      <span>🌊 Ocean currents</span><span>⭐ Navigating by the stars</span><span>🐬 Dolphins</span><span>🐋 Whales</span><span>🐟 Flying fish</span><span>🐢 Sea turtles</span><span>🪸 Coral reefs</span><span>🕊️ Seabirds</span><span>🏝️ Remote islands</span>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center;max-width:58ch;margin:22px auto 0;color:#555;">And whenever they spot something floating that doesn't belong in the ocean, they scoop it up — because every small act of care makes the sea a little better for everyone who lives there.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= MORE ADVENTURES COMING SOON ================= -->
<section class="wrap" id="coming-soon">
  <div class="section-head reveal" style="text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">
    <span class="eyebrow">More Adventures Coming Soon</span>
    <h2>Koa's next adventures are already being planned</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="next-adventures reveal-group reveal" style="max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;">
    {% for slug in ["fiji", "samoa", "vanuatu"] %}
    {% set d = findBySlug(destinations, slug) %}
    <div class="next-card">
      <div class="next-card-art">{{ destinationArt(d, "#4A7A7A") }}</div>
      <div class="next-card-body">
        <h3>{{ d.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ d.hook }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
